  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HimalPartner Capacity development for Nepali Renewable Energy Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will assist Butwal Technical Institute (BTI) in developing technical vocational study programmes for 1) the operation of CNC machines and 2) building and construction, aiming to meet the needs of the Nepali hydropower prduction and service value chain. Knarvik Upper Secondary School will provide technical support.</narrative>
  </description>
